# The vertical (1080×1920) preset for Shorts and Reels (S37 §3.4). Typed commands stay at 42
# columns or fewer (a test checks every tape that sources this file); text sits inside the shared
# safe box x 65 to 888, y 288 to 1248 once the editor places the terminal in y 300 to 980.
Source examples/demo/tapes/_brand.tape
Set FontSize 36
Set Width 1080
Set Height 1920
Set Padding 64
